<title>USA: Mednet says president, ceo resigns.</title>
<headline>Mednet says president, ceo resigns.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mednet MPC Corp said M.B. Merryman resigned as president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Merryman, who joined Mednet as president in 1988, will remain a consultant through December 31, 1997 and will continue as a member of the Board of Directors.</p>
<p>It said chief financial officer Thomas Warren was named as interim president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>A five-member committee of board members was also appointed as an executive search committee to interview and select a permanent replacement for Dr. Merryman.</p>
</text>
